<!--
  AI TUTOR PROTOTYPE — v4
  ==========================================================
  NEW IN THIS VERSION:
  1. Quiz check-in  -> "Quick check" button under each tutor reply,
     generates a 1-question MCQ via a separate (short, non-history)
     API call and scores it.
  2. Session progress -> topics-covered count + quiz score shown
     in the header stats.
  3. "Explain differently" -> button under each tutor reply that
     re-asks for the same concept with a different analogy.
  4. 3D fallback state -> when no concept keyword matches, the panel
     shows an explicit "no 3D visual for this" placeholder instead
     of leaving a stale unrelated model on screen.
  5. Sample question chips -> 3 example questions per subject,
     click to auto-fill and send.
  6. Grade-aware tone -> playful/story-first for grades 6-8,
     balanced for 9-10, exam-focused/concise for 11-12.
-->
<div style="max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto;">

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Kalam:wght@400;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js"></script>

<style>
  .tutor-app { font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #2b2a28; }

  .tutor-header {
    background: #23413a; color: #f5f1e6; padding: 22px 28px 22px 40px;
    border-radius: 14px 14px 0 0; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
